  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="32.352837" lon="77.117592"><name>Dhundi Bridge Trailhead</name><ele>2840.0</ele><desc>Roadhead entry 8 km past Solang Valley. Forest permit entry.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.35313" lon="77.086334"><name>Bhojpatra Birch Forest Stream</name><ele>3080.0</ele><desc>Ancient silver birch woodlands. Last reliable surface water before moraine.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.363514" lon="77.0848"><name>Bakarthach Shepherd Meadows</name><ele>3300.0</ele><desc>Expansive alpine meadow camp with views of Hanuman Tibba and Indrasan.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.36545" lon="77.085225"><name>Terminal Moraine Boulder Scramble</name><ele>3520.0</ele><desc>Water flows sub-surface. Carry 2L from Bakarthach. Follow stone cairns through loose scree.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.366186" lon="77.085605"><name>Beas Kund Sacred Tarn</name><ele>3700.0</ele><desc>Sacred glacial origin of River Beas cradled beneath Friendship Peak and Shitidhar.</desc></wpt>
